flowchart TB
    subgraph node[Numax node]
        guest[WASM module - local compute]
        host[Host API - nx-core]
        store[nx-store - embedded sled]
        sync[Optional CRDT sync - nx-core using nx-sync and nx-net]
        guest -->|Local API calls| host
        host -->|Ordinary KV reads and writes| store
        host -->|CRDT operations| sync
        sync -->|Local CRDT persistence| store
    end
    peers[Other Numax nodes]
    sync <-.->|When enabled: CRDT operations| peers
